    "title": "Former Austin police chief Joseph Chacon officially sworn in as Taylor's new police chief - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Stephanie Gonzalez ,\n3 hours ago TAYLOR, Texas — Former Austin Police Chief Joseph Chacon was officially sworn in as the new chief of the Taylor Police Department on Wednesday evening, city officials announced. Chacon took the oath of office during a ceremony held at the Taylor Public Library. Judge Rhonda Redden administered the oath. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
